---
layout: layout.html
title: Mrs & Mrs Maps
subtitle: Honest travel notes for queer couples who care about design, safety, and budget
eyebrow: Featured frontend sample
intro: A magazine-style landing page highlighting recent writing, practical trip filters, and a stronger visual identity.
pageClass: home-page
---

{% set mostRecent = collections.posts[collections.posts.length - 1] %}

<section class="landingGrid">
    <article class="featureCard">
        <div class="featureCard__media">
            <span class="sectionTag">Latest post</span>
            <img src="{{ mostRecent.data.image | safe }}" alt="{{ mostRecent.data.title | safe }}">
        </div>
        <div class="featureCard__content">
            <p class="featureCard__kicker">Field notes from the road</p>
            <h2>{{ mostRecent.data.title | safe }}</h2>
            <p class="featureCard__meta">By {{ mostRecent.data.author | safe }}</p>
            <div class="featureCard__body">
                {{ mostRecent.templateContent | safe }}
            </div>
            <a class="buttonLink" href="/posts/">Browse all posts</a>
        </div>
    </article>

    <aside class="infoRail">
        <span class="sectionTag">What we track</span>
        <div class="statGrid">
            <div>
                <strong>Budget</strong>
                <span>Low-cost stays, cheap eats, transit wins</span>
            </div>
            <div>
                <strong>Food</strong>
                <span>Street food first, tourist traps last</span>
            </div>
            <div>
                <strong>Safety</strong>
                <span>Queer-friendly impressions from real trips</span>
            </div>
        </div>
        <p class="railNote">Designed to read quickly: strong hierarchy, restrained framing, and responsive sections that still feel intentional on mobile.</p>
    </aside>
</section>

<section class="homeStrip">
    <div class="homeStrip__copy">
        <span class="sectionTag">Travel lens</span>
        <h2>Fast, opinionated, and easy to scan.</h2>
        <p>The site is structured so readers can move from inspiration to practical details quickly, without losing personality.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="pillRow">
        <span>Editorial layout</span>
        <span>Responsive navigation</span>
        <span>Custom typography</span>
        <span>Image-led storytelling</span>
    </div>
</section>
